                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda, Shalumu mwene Yabeshi akatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera okwezi kumwe omuri Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Menahemu mwene Gaadi yaaruga Tiruza, yaija Samaria, yaitirayo Shalumu mwene Yabeshi, yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endiijo mirimo ya Shalumu yoona, n'okugoma oku yaagomire, reeba bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omu biro ebyo Menahemu akateera Tifusa, yaagicwekyereza n'abaabaire barimu boona, n'ebyaro byayo byona okuruga Tiruza okuhika aha myatano yaayo; eki yaagicwekyerereize n'ahabw'okuba bakanga kumwigurira amarembo, kandi n'abakazi baamwo abaabaire baine enda yaabashatura aha nda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
