        },
        {
          "text": " Eizooba rimwe Puuli omugabe wa Asiria yaateera egyo nsi; Menahemu yaamuhongyera etalanta z'efeeza rukumi, ngu amuhwere abone kuhama omu bugabe bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ezo mpiiha Menahemu akaba aziihire omu batungi boona ab'omuri Israeli, buri muntu omuribo shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano, ngu abone kuziha ogwo mugabe wa Asiria. N'ahabw'ekyo omugabe wa Asiria yaakuba yaagarukayo, tiyaaguma muri egyo nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Menahemu n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru; omutabani Pekahia yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa makumi ataano ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda Pekahia mwne Menahemu akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria; yaamar aemyaka ebiri ari aha ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
