        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro bya Peeka omugabe wa Israeli Tigulaasi-pileseeri omugabe wa Asiria yaija, yaakwata Iyooni, Abeelibesi-maaka, Yanoa, Kedeshi, Hazori, Gileadi na Galilaaya, ensi yoona eya Nafutaali; kandi abantu yaabatwara Asiria bari enkwatwa. ",
