                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Hoshea mwene Ela yaagiira Peeka mwene Remalia omu naama, yaamuteera, yaamwita; yaatandika kutegyeka omu mwanya gwe omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Yosamu mwene Uziya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
